rum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/102367-dragon-blooded-power-level-in-3e?p=105704#post105704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was subtly asking you guys to please tell me who is on the dev team and what else they have written. :P</div> </div> </div> </div>The dev team is John and Holden. They're the developers. Everyone else\u2014me, Minton, Liz, Lea, Brennan, anyone I'm forgetting\u2014they's just writers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-04T12:11:39-07:00","id":105732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/102367-dragon-blooded-power-level-in-3e?p=105716#post105716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The dev team is John and Holden. They're the developers. Everyone else\u2014me, Minton, Liz, Lea, Brennan, anyone I'm forgetting\u2014they's just writers!</div> </div> </div> </div>I need to stop compulsively putting &quot;dev&quot; in front of the word &quot;team&quot;. Edited.<br /> <br /> But to be honest, I'm more interested in who <b>Drascin's </b>friends think is &quot;bad&quot; rather than who is actually making the game. (I have a sneaking suspicion that those two lists won't match up as closely as Drascin thinks they do.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 04-04-2014, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-04T19:09:07-07:00","id":105975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/102367-dragon-blooded-power-level-in-3e?p=105732#post105732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I need to stop compulsively putting &quot;dev&quot; in front of the word &quot;team&quot;. Edited.<br /> <br /> But to be honest, I'm more interested in who <b>Drascin's </b>friends think is &quot;bad&quot; rather than who is actually making the game. (I have a sneaking suspicion that those two lists won't match up as closely as Drascin thinks they do.)</div> </div> </div> </div>You'd be surprised.<br /> <br /> I think that one of the unfortunate things that people who write for tabletop games have to deal with is that (unlike almost every other type of game or media out there) the amount of fun you have with a tabletop game is mostly outside of their hands. Don't get me wrong, there's a huge difference between a good game and a bad game, but honestly -- D&amp;D has ruled the market for a generation now, despite being (in most of its incarnations, by most of the standards we judge other games) pretty shoddy mechanically, extremely inconsistent in writing and design quality, and so on. None of these things have ever had even the slightest appreciable impact on D&amp;D's status. I mean, heck, the biggest hit it took was when it tried to overhaul things to produce <i>better</i> mechanics in 4e.<br /> <br /> And the reason for that is because most of the time, the fun you have from a tabletop game comes more from your DM (or ST or whatever) and the other players than from the system. You can have more fun playing FATAL with good friends than you can playing Nobilis with jerks. On top of this, players associate the fun they had playing with a system with that system, even though most of it probably came from who they were playing with; and there's an intense nostalgia factor associated with systems you've used to play games you enjoyed.<br /> <br /> This is why the Ink Monkey and errata stuff from the end of 2e caused a backlash (and they did -- it wasn't huge; I mean, it was definitely mostly well-received. But there was also a vocal backlash.) People sensed that the game they'd had fun playing was being taken in a somewhat different direction, and (even though, to the extent that it was, it was mostly just to hotpatch some of the most glaring problems in 2e!) some of them reacted with &quot;WHY U TAKIN AWAY OUR FUN?&quot; Because most readers don't know anything about game design; even when they notice the system behaving oddly, many of them are going to say &quot;the guy across the table is a total munchkin&quot; or whatever rather than understanding what went wrong.<br /> <br /> These forums are sometimes a bit more aware, but that's because we've been shouting at each other about these things constantly for years -- even then, early in the edition, you'd see people arguing with Jon Chung telling him that Scroll of the Monk was totally fine (and if it had ever been errataed, there are people just like them out in the wilderness who would, absolutely, have complained &quot;WHY U RUIN SCROLL OF MONK?!&quot;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","user":"Aquillion","date":". 04-06-2014, 06:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T00:31:04-07:00","id":106770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/102367-dragon-blooded-power-level-in-3e?p=105975#post105975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can have more fun <b>playing FATAL</b> with good friends than you can playing Nobilis with jerks.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I agree with most of your post, I must ask if <i>any</i> fun could be had from the most infamous of the Unholy Trinity that does not involve scourging it with holy promethium.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;We do not quit playing because we grow old, we grow old because we quit playing.&quot; - Oliver Wendell Holmes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/283-mrinsecure","name":"MrInsecure","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T00:37:28-07:00","id":106774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrInsecure</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/102367-dragon-blooded-power-level-in-3e?p=106770#post106770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I agree with most of your post, I must ask if <i>any</i> fun could be had from the most infamous of the Unholy Trinity that does not involve scourging it with holy promethium.</div> </div> </div> </div>I own the PDF, I spent an afternoon having fun just looking through it and wondering what the hell is going on, in a Plan 9 from Outer Space sort of way, the list of spell-fumbles is particularly hilarious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T15:55:10-07:00","id":107122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrInsecure</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/102367-dragon-blooded-power-level-in-3e?p=106770#post106770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I agree with most of your post, I must ask if <i>any</i> fun could be had from the most infamous of the <b>Unholy Trinity</b> that does not involve scourging it with holy promethium.</div> </div> </div> </div>(Emphasis mine.)<br /> <br /> What are the other two members of the Unholy Trinity? Masochistically curious minds want to know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","name":"Aranis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar42_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[